description.narrative:
General question: Results related to the intended outcome 2014Question: Summarise results related to the intended outcome (this information will be sent to Open Aid)Answer: Repoa's overall objectives 
During January-December 2014 REPOA strived to : 

(i) Give greater space to strategic research; 

(ii) Place greater emphasis on quality of output; 

(iii) Enhance in-house research capacity, 

(iv) Capitalize on synergy and complementarity among strategic research, collaborative research and commissioned studies, 

(v) Enhance synergy in the information and communication functions for effective knowledge sharing and accessibility; 

(vi) Forge strategic alliances with key stakeholders with a view to influencing their behavior and action using the knowledge generated by REPOA 

(vii) Consolidate outcome and results based performance management and organizational learning.
